ssed memory, said (Sotah 5, ) that put aside the Holy One blessed be He all the mountains and not gave the Torah except on mount Sinai and our sages, of blessed memory, said (there 5:) that prayer of the low no despised as written (Psalms 51): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>heart broken</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; etc and through prayer which in self-sacrifice that nullifies all his materiality and no boundary and when no boundary then can to perceive the Torah that for the future which she no boundary and no grasped in boundary.</span></p><p><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><span style="letter-spacing: 2.4pt"><b>5.</b></span></span></p><p><span class="body-text">And this that said Rabba bar bar Chana: to me seen to me that akrokta, that was as akra of Hagronia. And akra of Hagronia how was? sixty houses came tannina swallowed it. came pushkantsa and swallowed it to tannina, and ascended sat in tree. come see how much great power of tree. said Rav Papa bar Shmuel: if not that was there not believed him. Rashbam: akrokta frog as akra of Hagronia great was as that city. and akra of Hagronia how was, sixty houses Talmud says to it. came tannina Rabba says to it. pushkantsa raven female. in tree on branch one as way of the birds. not believed not believed. akrokta explained our rabbi Shmuel: frog and this aspect of ascent of the&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp;to its root that is knowledge because frog she word composed: bird of knowledge (Tanna Devei Eliyahu 6 and in kavanos of the Haggadah) and bird is aspect of&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp;aspect of land as written (Isaiah 24): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>from wing of the earth songs</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; etc and as written (there 60): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>who these</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; letters G-d as cloud fly etc and knowledge she root of the&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp