nd who made cruel on his sons as raven that is that prays without any intention of his own benefit and not thinks anything himself and nullified all his self and his materiality and nullified as if not in the world as written (Psalms 44): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>because for You killed us all the day</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; and this aspect of (Song of Songs 5): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>black as raven</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; and through this: ascended and sat in tree that merits to aspects Torah that in hidden as written (Psalms 18): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>places darkness His hiding</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; that secrets of Torah man merits to them through darkness that is self-sacrifice that blackens his face as raven because they aspect of darkness on name depth of the concept and this aspect of: ascended and sat in tree that there dwelling of the souls as written (Zohar Mishpatim 99:):&nbsp;</span><span class="body-text"><b>all souls from great tree go out</b></span><span class="body-text">&nbsp;and it aspect of world to come that there length of days as written (Isaiah 65): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>as days of tree days of My people</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; and this merits through prayer because the Holy One blessed be He desires to prayer of Israel (see Chullin 60:) and when Israel pray before Him and fulfill His desire then made as it were in aspect of woman which receives pleasure from with him as written (Numbers 28): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>fire fragrance soothing to Hashem</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; through the fragrance soothing that receives made in aspect of woman &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>and female surrounds man</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; (Jeremiah 31) that the Holy One blessed be He made in aspect of garment revealed that is from aspect that was from beginning in hidden now revealed through the prayer and Kudsha Brich Hu and Torah all one and then through the prayer revealed Torah, that is secrets of Torah come see how much great power of this tree that is, how much great power of this secrets of Torah that no can to clothe in any thing limited in any body except in who blackens his face as raven and made as raven on his sons.</span></p><p><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><span style="letter-spacing: 2.4pt"><b>6.</b></span></span></p><p><span class="body-text">And this aspect of (Avos 6): five acquisitions that acquired in His world Torah acquisition one this aspect of Torah that in revealed heavens and earth acquisition one this aspect of raising of the&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp;to the knowledge land this aspect of&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp;as above and heavens this aspect of knowledge because knowledge is connection as written (Genesis 4): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>and the man knew</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; and this aspect of heavens fire and water connected together (Chagigah 12) Abraham acquisition one this aspect of prayer aspect of sixty houses sixty they queens as above Israel acquisition one this aspect of&nbsp;</span>judgment<span class="body-text">&nbsp;that raises the&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp;as above as written (Psalms 147): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>His statutes and His judgments to Israel</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; Temple acquisition one this aspect of secrets of Torah that merit to them through the prayer which is aspect of Abraham and this (there 78): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>mount this acquired His right</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; that this right, aspect of prayer, aspect of Abraham and called mount on name depth of the concept and called Temple aspects of holy aspects of beginning &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>and all stranger not eat holy</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; (Leviticus 22) and not eat in it except its sanctified and its readers and Temple it aspect of secrets of Torah.</span></p><p><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><span style="letter-spacing: 2.4pt"><b>7.</b></span></span></p><p><span class="body-text">And this interpretation: and you shall be to Me kingdom of priests kingdom this aspect of Torah that in revealed because &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>in it kings reign</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; (Proverbs 8) and kingship is aspect of revealed because no king without people and all need to king because all need to owner of wheat and priests this aspect of prayer aspects of Abraham as above as our sages, of blessed memory, said (Nedarim 32:) that said the Holy One blessed be He to Abraham: you priest forever etc and nation holy this aspect of Temple aspects of Torah that in hidden, called holy and through what merits to these aspects? through that raises and connects aspect of&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp;through&nbsp;</span>judgment<span class="body-text">&nbsp;to aspect of knowledge as above and this: these the things that you speak this aspect of&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">, called thing because main the speech there it as our sages, of blessed memory, said (Berachos 6:):&nbsp;</span><span class="body-text"><b>who has in him fear of heaven, his words heard</b></span><span class="body-text">&nbsp;Moshe he aspect of knowledge and this: that you speak specifically and this (Exodus 18): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>when there is to them thing comes to me</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; that Israel who they aspect of&nbsp;</span>judgment<span class="body-text">&nbsp;as above they raise and connect [the&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">] to aspect of Moshe to aspect of knowledge and this: to children of Israel specifically because they aspect of&nbsp;</span>judgment<span class="body-text">&nbsp;as written: &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>His statutes and His judgments to Israel</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; it is found, that through that connect the&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp;through&nbsp;</span>judgment<span class="body-text">&nbsp;to aspect of knowledge merit to the Torah that revealed and through Torah that in revealed merit to prayer and through prayer merit to secrets of Torah thing this aspect of&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp;as written (Malachi 3): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>then spoke fearers of Hashem</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot;.</span></p><p><span style="text-transform: uppercase"><span style="letter-spacing: 2.4pt"><b>8.</b></span></span></p><p><span class="body-text">This the Torah belongs on verse (Psalms 101): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>my eyes in faithful of land</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; etc my eyes this aspects of knowledge as written (Genesis 3): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>and opened eyes of both</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; also knowledge they ten names [Havayah] gematria two times eye as known in faithful this aspect of Aharon as brought in midrash Shocher Tov and Aharon he aspect of&nbsp;</span>judgment<span class="body-text">&nbsp;as written (Exodus 28): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>and Aharon bear the judgment of children of Israel</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; land this aspects of&nbsp;</span>fear<span class="body-text">&nbsp;as above to sit with me this aspects of Sinai, lowliness, &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>I dwell with crushed</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; (Isaiah 57) as above walks in way perfect this aspects of prayer, aspect of Abraham as above as written (Genesis 17): &quot;</span><span class="body-text"><b>walk before Me and be perfect</b></span><span class="body-text">&quot; he shall serve me this aspect of secrets of Torah this aspect of he, aspects of world to co